# Forms go-live (milestone 6) — see DEPLOYMENT.md § "Forms, captcha & email".
# Copy to .env for local dev, or set as real env vars in the build environment.
#
# BOTH values below are PUBLIC — they are baked into the built HTML (Astro
# only exposes PUBLIC_* to client code), so they are safe to write here.
#
# The SECRETS deliberately have no place in this repo or on this host:
#   - Turnstile SECRET key  → Cloudflare Worker env (wrangler secret put)
#   - SMTP / Resend / MailChannels credentials → Cloudflare Worker env
# The Worker form relay verifies Turnstile and emails info@foodhacks.co.
# NOTE: this site's contact form is currently action="#" (does nothing) —
# it MUST be wired to the relay (or a mailto fallback) before launch.

# Cloudflare Turnstile *site* key (public; dashboard → Turnstile → widget
# covering all four domains).
PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=

# URL of the shared form-relay Worker endpoint, e.g.
# https://forms.<your-workers-subdomain>.workers.dev/foodhacks
PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT=

# Newsletter (optional, pending owner provider choice — Brevo/Buttondown/etc.)
# Set only when a provider is chosen; the footer blurb is text-only until then.
#PUBLIC_NEWSLETTER_ENDPOINT=
